  "body": "Positioned on an approximately 199sqm freehold site in the growing Strathmill community, this brand-new single-level home offers a wonderful balance of modern comfort, practical design and easy-care living. With an approximate 101sqm floor area (including porch), an open outlook and the added peace of mind of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it presents an appealing opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n- Brand-new, single-level home on approximately 199sqm of freehold land\r\n\r\n- Approximately 101sqm floor area, including porch\r\n\r\n- Three well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n\r\n- Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a welcoming heart of the home\r\n\r\n- Modern kitchen with a practical layout and excellent functionality\r\n\r\n- Master bedroom complete with its own ensuite and direct access to the outdoor living area\r\n\r\n- Private, easy-care outdoor space, ideal for relaxing or entertaining\r\n\r\n- Internal-access single garage plus an additional off-street parking space\r\n\r\n- Open outlook, enhancing the home's sense of space and connection to its surroundings\r\n\r\n- 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nSet within the growing Strathmill community, this home offers an appealing balance of everyday convenience and coastal living. With easy access to the motorway, commuting is straightforward, while beautiful Orewa Beach, local cafés, restaurants, shops and schools are all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nCombining the ease of single-level living with the appeal of a brand-new home, this is an opportunity to enjoy modern comfort in a well-connected coastal location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing!",
